# Enhance Contact Window with AI Chat & Portfolio Knowledge Copilot

Enhance the existing Contact Window into an interactive dual-tab retro terminal experience featuring:
1. **AI Portfolio Copilot (Instant Chat)**: An intelligent AI assistant that answers questions about Joseph Amandy's skills, dives through his GitHub repositories (`@Tephdy`) and Behance design portfolio, and **creates tailored implementation plans** whenever a visitor asks for a project not currently in his portfolio.
2. **Outlook Express (Email Form)**: The existing retro contact form submitting to Web3Forms for direct messaging.

---

## User Review Required

> [!IMPORTANT]
> **AI Engine & API Key Support**
> - **Dual-Engine Architecture**:
>   - **Gemini API (`@google/genai`)**: Wired via Next.js server route (`/api/chat`) using Gemini 2.5 / 2.0 Flash. When a `GEMINI_API_KEY` environment variable is provided, it uses live LLM generation with deep reasoning.
>   - **Intelligent Built-in Fallback**: If no API key is present (or when deployed statically), the chat seamlessly uses an intelligent knowledge reasoning engine ([`src/lib/portfolioAi.ts`](file:///d:/TEPHDYTECH/WEB%20APP/PORTFOLIO/src/lib/portfolioAi.ts)). This guarantees the chat works 100% out of the box with zero runtime configuration errors.

